Wait, one more important consideration: `activo_promovido`:
```julia
function activo_promovido(Ep, P, slot, k)
    E2 = clonar(Ep)
    promover!(E2, slot, true)
    return activo_de(E2, k)
end
```
For a transition block, `Ep.fase == FasePoW` and `promover!(E2, slot, true)` uses `es_post=true`, promoting pendientes with `madura_en_slot`. In the terminal PoW state, pendientes have `madura_en_slot = s0 + M_dep_slots`. With s0=0, at slot pslot=1, if M_dep_slots=1, it promotes. Good. This matches `aplicar_post!`.

Now, `ids_gastados(pref)`:
```julia
function ids_gastados(pref)
    s = Set{Int}()
    for b in pref, tx in b.txs, e in tx.entradas
        push!(s, e)
    end
    return s
end
```

